      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngomnyaka wetshumi lanye, ngosuku lokuqala enyangeni yesithathu, ilizwi leNkosi lafika kimi lathi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndoda, tshono kuFaro inkosi yaseGibithe lakubo bonke abantu bakhe uthi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho iNkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Ngenxa yokuba waba mude, izihloko zawo zathinta amayezi, inhliziyo yawo yaziphakamisa ngobude bawo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngizawunikela esandleni sesikhulu sezizweni; sizakuwuphatha ngokufanele ububi bawo. Sengiwulahlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abezizweni abalesihluku kulazo zonke izizwe bazawuquma bawulahle; ingatsha zawo zizawela ezintabeni lasezihotsheni; zizakwephukela ezifuleni zelizwe, labantu bonke bomhlaba basuke emthunzini wawo, bawutshiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nxa usuwile, zonke inyoni zaphezulu zizahlala phezu kwawo, lenyamazana zonke zeganga zihlale phezu kwengatsha zawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lokhu kwenzelwa ukuba kungabi lasihlahla ngasemanzini esikhula sibe side kakhulu, lezihloko zaso zithinte amayezi, kungabi lasihlahla esinatha amanzi esifinyelela emayezini; ngoba zonke zimiselwe ukufa, ziye elizweni elingaphansi komhlaba, njengabantu abafileyo abehlela phansi egodini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi uNkulunkulu ithi: Lapho umkusu usuwehlele endaweni yabafileyo, ngizakwenza okungaphansi komhlaba kuwulilele, ngimise imifula yawo, ngivimbele amanzi amanengi. Ngizasibekela iLebanoni ngomnyama ngenxa yawo, lezihlahla zonke zizadana ngenxa yawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngizakwenza zonke izizwe zithuthumele ngomdumo wokuwa kwawo, lapho ngiwuphosela endaweni yabafileyo kanye lalabo abehlela egodini. Zonke izihlahla zaseEdeni, ezikhethiweyo lezinhle zaseLebanoni, zonke ezinatha amanzi, zizaduduzwa elizweni elingaphansi komhlaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lazo zizakuya endaweni yabafileyo kanye lawo, kubo ababulewe empini. Yebo, labo abahlala ngaphansi komthunzi wawo phakathi kwezizwe bazabhubha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phoke, wena ufana lobani ngodumo langobukhulu ezihlahleni zaseEdeni na? Uzakwehliselwa elizweni elingaphansi komhlaba lezihlahla zaseEdeni, ulale phakathi kwabangasokanga, kanye labo ababulewe empini. Lo nguFaro lalo lonke ixuku lakhe, kutsho iNkosi uNkulunkulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.31.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
